lleagues\" indicating poor cooperation. So we have enough.\n\nWe need to make a contribution: maybe we agree with Candidate C but note concerns about communication and egocentric attitude, and suggest we need more evidence on adaptability. Could ask about Candidate D's stress resilience. But we can just give our recommendation.\n\nGiven the current leading candidate is C, we can either support or propose alternative. Let's support C but note concerns, and suggest we need to verify communication impact. So vote Candidate C.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I concur with Agent 1's recommendation of Candidate C...\". Provide evidence: reliability, quick correct decisions, positive crew atmosphere, calm in crisis. Acknowledge communication difficulty and egocentric but weigh against strengths. Vote C.\n\nProceed."}
